Hello,

I've tested the plug after boot method, and it seems like it is working to
get the dock full resources and stay stable.

For the second question:
It appears to me like the dock's xHCI is showing up as a distinct PCI
device. (0000:0c:00.0 Goshen Ridge) instead of tunneling. I've compiled
together some evidence towards this from my investigation in attached md
file.

Also, if it's useful I tried a cold boot with connected dock with
pci=3Drealloc as a boot option after gathering these captures. The control
died in the same way as initially shared.

Best,
Ben

